      <title>Coherent Corp. Announces Timing of FY2026 Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year-End Earnings Release</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>SAXONBURG, Pa., July  22, 2026  (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Coherent Corp. (NYSE: COHR) (“Coherent,” “We,” or the “Company”), a global leader in photonics, announced today that it will release its financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, on Wednesday, August 12, after the New York Stock Exchange closes. The release will be followed by a live audio webcast at 4:30 p.m. ET to discuss the results.</p>]]></description>
